IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `dg-core`

-- Delaware General Corporation Law, 8 Del. C. ch. 1 -- piece dg5, layer 1.
-- Sections 243 (retirement of stock), 244 (reduction of capital), 245 (restated certificate of incorporation) and 246 ([Reserved.]: no provision).
--
-- The source is the plain-text rendering de-code-t8-ch1-2026-10-01.txt of the Delaware Code Online (through 85 Del. Laws, c. 550).
-- It is not the official text. `-- src:N | ...` is line N of that file; an ellipsis means the line goes on.
--
-- Section 114(b)(2) takes sections 243 and 244 out of the stockholder-to-member reading: they speak of capital stock and its holders only.
-- "Capital", "surplus" and "net assets" are defined in section 154 (piece dg3); the amounts of capital are facts the person can state (dollars).
-- Filing and effectiveness are section 103 (piece dg1); the sections referred to in section 104 are piece dg1.

§ `Section 243 -- retirement of stock`

-- src:1034 | (a) A corporation, by resolution of its board of directors, may retire any shares of its capital stock that are issued but are not outstanding.
@ref 8 Del. C. § 243(a) (src:1034)
GIVEN `the board of directors adopted a resolution to retire the shares` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the shares are issued but are not outstanding` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 243(a) the corporation may retire the shares` `the board of directors adopted a resolution to retire the shares` `the shares are issued but are not outstanding` MEANS
        `the board of directors adopted a resolution to retire the shares`
    AND `the shares are issued but are not outstanding`

-- src:1035 | Whenever any shares of the capital stock of a corporation are retired, they shall resume the status of authorized and unissued shares of the class or series to which they belong unless the certificate of incorporation otherwise provides. …
@ref 8 Del. C. § 243(b) (src:1035)
DECLARE `dg5 s 243(b) Status of retired shares` IS ONE OF
    `they resume the status of authorized and unissued shares of the class or series to which they belong`
    `their status is what the certificate of incorporation provides`

@ref 8 Del. C. § 243(b) (src:1035)
GIVEN `the certificate of incorporation otherwise provides` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `dg5 s 243(b) Status of retired shares`
`s 243(b) the status of the retired shares` `the certificate of incorporation otherwise provides` MEANS
    IF `the certificate of incorporation otherwise provides`
    THEN `their status is what the certificate of incorporation provides`
    ELSE `they resume the status of authorized and unissued shares of the class or series to which they belong`

-- src:1035 | If the certificate of incorporation prohibits the reissuance of such shares, or prohibits the reissuance of such shares as a part of a specific series only, a certificate stating that reissuance of the shares (as part of the class or series) is prohibited identifying the shares and reciting their retirement shall be executed, acknowledged and filed and shall become effective in accordance with § 103 of this title. …
@ref 8 Del. C. § 243(b) (src:1035)
GIVEN `the certificate of incorporation prohibits the reissuance of the shares, or prohibits their reissuance as part of a specific series only` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 243(b) a certificate stating that reissuance of the shares is prohibited must be filed` `the certificate of incorporation prohibits the reissuance of the shares, or prohibits their reissuance as part of a specific series only` MEANS
    `the certificate of incorporation prohibits the reissuance of the shares, or prohibits their reissuance as part of a specific series only`

-- "it shall have the effect of amending the certificate of incorporation so as to reduce accordingly the number of authorized shares of the class or series to which such shares belong".
-- NOTHING: more shares retired than were authorized, which cannot be.
-- src:1035 | When such certificate becomes effective, it shall have the effect of amending the certificate of incorporation so as to reduce accordingly the number of authorized shares of the class or series to which such shares belong or, if such retired shares constitute all of the authorized shares of the class or series to which they belong, of eliminating from the certificate of incorporation all reference to such class or series of stock.
@ref 8 Del. C. § 243(b) (src:1035)
GIVEN `the number of authorized shares of the class or series before the certificate becomes effective` IS A NUMBER
      `the number of retired shares whose reissuance is prohibited` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A MAYBE NUMBER
`s 243(b) the number of authorized shares of the class or series after the certificate becomes effective` `the number of authorized shares of the class or series before the certificate becomes effective` `the number of retired shares whose reissuance is prohibited` MEANS
    IF   `the number of retired shares whose reissuance is prohibited` AT LEAST 0
     AND `the number of retired shares whose reissuance is prohibited` AT MOST `the number of authorized shares of the class or series before the certificate becomes effective`
    THEN JUST (`the number of authorized shares of the class or series before the certificate becomes effective` MINUS `the number of retired shares whose reissuance is prohibited`)
    ELSE NOTHING

-- "if such retired shares constitute all of the authorized shares of the class or series to which they belong, of eliminating from the certificate of incorporation all reference to such class or series".
@ref 8 Del. C. § 243(b) (src:1035)
GIVEN `the number of authorized shares of the class or series before the certificate becomes effective` IS A NUMBER
      `the number of retired shares whose reissuance is prohibited` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 243(b) all reference to the class or series is eliminated from the certificate` `the number of authorized shares of the class or series before the certificate becomes effective` `the number of retired shares whose reissuance is prohibited` MEANS
        `the number of authorized shares of the class or series before the certificate becomes effective` GREATER THAN 0
    AND `the number of retired shares whose reissuance is prohibited` EQUALS `the number of authorized shares of the class or series before the certificate becomes effective`

-- src:1036 | (c) If the capital of the corporation will be reduced by or in connection with the retirement of shares, the reduction of capital shall be effected pursuant to § 244 of this title.
@ref 8 Del. C. § 243(c) (src:1036)
GIVEN `the capital of the corporation will be reduced by or in connection with the retirement of shares` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 243(c) the reduction of capital must be effected pursuant to s 244` `the capital of the corporation will be reduced by or in connection with the retirement of shares` MEANS
    `the capital of the corporation will be reduced by or in connection with the retirement of shares`

§ `Section 244 -- reduction of capital`

-- src:1040 | (a) A corporation, by resolution of its board of directors, may reduce its capital in any of the following ways:
-- src:1041 | (1) By reducing or eliminating the capital represented by shares of capital stock which have been retired;
-- src:1042 | (2) By applying to an otherwise authorized purchase or redemption of outstanding shares of its capital stock some or all of the capital represented by the shares being purchased or redeemed, or any capital that has not been allocated to any particular class of its capital stock;
-- src:1043 | (3) By applying to an otherwise authorized conversion or exchange of outstanding shares of its capital stock some or all of the capital represented by the shares being converted or exchanged, or some or all of any capital that has not been allocated to any particular class of its capital stock, or both, to the extent that such capital in the aggregate exceeds the total aggregate par value or the stated capital of any previously unissued shares issuable upon such conversion or exchange; or
-- src:1044 | (4) By transferring to surplus (i) some or all of the capital not represented by any particular class of its capital stock; (ii) some or all of the capital represented by issued shares of its par value capital stock, which capital is in excess of the aggregate par value of such shares; or (iii) some of the capital represented by issued shares of its capital stock without par value.
@ref 8 Del. C. § 244(a) (src:1040-1044)
DECLARE `dg5 s 244(a) Way of reducing capital` IS ONE OF
    `by reducing or eliminating the capital represented by shares of capital stock which have been retired`
    `by applying to an otherwise authorized purchase or redemption of outstanding shares some or all of the capital represented by the shares being purchased or redeemed, or any capital that has not been allocated to any particular class of its capital stock`
    `by applying to an otherwise authorized conversion or exchange of outstanding shares some or all of the capital represented by the shares being converted or exchanged, or some or all of any capital not allocated to a class, or both, to the extent that such capital in the aggregate exceeds the total aggregate par value or the stated capital of any previously unissued shares issuable upon the conversion or exchange`
    `by transferring to surplus some or all of the capital not represented by any particular class of its capital stock`
    `by transferring to surplus some or all of the capital represented by issued shares of its par value capital stock, which capital is in excess of the aggregate par value of such shares`
    `by transferring to surplus some of the capital represented by issued shares of its capital stock without par value`

-- out of range: section 154 (piece dg3)
@ref 8 Del. C. § 244(a) (src:1040-1044)
DECLARE `dg5 s 244(a) Proposed reduction of capital` HAS
    `the way the capital is to be reduced`                       IS A `dg5 s 244(a) Way of reducing capital`
    `the board of directors adopted a resolution to reduce the capital` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the amount of capital to be reduced`                        IS A NUMBER
    `the capital represented by the retired shares`              IS A NUMBER
    `the capital represented by the shares being purchased, redeemed, converted or exchanged` IS A NUMBER
    `the capital that has not been allocated to any particular class of capital stock` IS A NUMBER
    `the total aggregate par value or stated capital of the previously unissued shares issuable upon the conversion or exchange` IS A NUMBER
    `the capital represented by the issued shares of par value capital stock` IS A NUMBER
    `the aggregate par value of those shares`                    IS A NUMBER
    `the capital represented by the issued shares of capital stock without par value` IS A NUMBER

-- The most that can be reduced in each way. (1): all the capital of the retired shares. (2): that of the shares purchased or redeemed plus unallocated capital.
-- (3): that capital "to the extent that such capital in the aggregate exceeds" the par value or stated capital of the unissued shares issuable (never below nothing).
-- (4)(i): the unallocated capital. (4)(ii): the capital of the issued par value shares "in excess of the aggregate par value". (4)(iii): "some of" the capital of the issued no-par shares,
-- read as part and not all (Fork F10).
@ref 8 Del. C. § 244(a) (src:1040-1044)
GIVEN r IS A `dg5 s 244(a) Proposed reduction of capital`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 244(a) the reduction of capital is of a kind and an amount the subsection permits` r MEANS
        r's `the board of directors adopted a resolution to reduce the capital`
    AND r's `the amount of capital to be reduced` AT LEAST 0
    AND (CONSIDER r's `the way the capital is to be reduced`
         WHEN `by reducing or eliminating the capital represented by shares of capital stock which have been retired` THEN
             r's `the amount of capital to be reduced` AT MOST r's `the capital represented by the retired shares`
         WHEN `by applying to an otherwise authorized purchase or redemption of outstanding shares some or all of the capital represented by the shares being purchased or redeemed, or any capital that has not been allocated to any particular class of its capital stock` THEN
             r's `the amount of capital to be reduced` AT MOST (r's `the capital represented by the shares being purchased, redeemed, converted or exchanged` PLUS r's `the capital that has not been allocated to any particular class of capital stock`)
         WHEN `by applying to an otherwise authorized conversion or exchange of outstanding shares some or all of the capital represented by the shares being converted or exchanged, or some or all of any capital not allocated to a class, or both, to the extent that such capital in the aggregate exceeds the total aggregate par value or the stated capital of any previously unissued shares issuable upon the conversion or exchange` THEN
             r's `the amount of capital to be reduced` AT MOST (max 0 ((r's `the capital represented by the shares being purchased, redeemed, converted or exchanged` PLUS r's `the capital that has not been allocated to any particular class of capital stock`) MINUS r's `the total aggregate par value or stated capital of the previously unissued shares issuable upon the conversion or exchange`))
         WHEN `by transferring to surplus some or all of the capital not represented by any particular class of its capital stock` THEN
             r's `the amount of capital to be reduced` AT MOST r's `the capital that has not been allocated to any particular class of capital stock`
         WHEN `by transferring to surplus some or all of the capital represented by issued shares of its par value capital stock, which capital is in excess of the aggregate par value of such shares` THEN
             r's `the amount of capital to be reduced` AT MOST (r's `the capital represented by the issued shares of par value capital stock` MINUS r's `the aggregate par value of those shares`)
         WHEN `by transferring to surplus some of the capital represented by issued shares of its capital stock without par value` THEN
                 r's `the amount of capital to be reduced` GREATER THAN 0
             AND r's `the amount of capital to be reduced` LESS THAN r's `the capital represented by the issued shares of capital stock without par value`)

-- "no reduction of capital shall be made or effected unless the assets of the corporation remaining after such reduction shall be sufficient to pay any debts of the corporation
-- for which payment has not been otherwise provided": the assets remaining reach the debts not otherwise provided for (Fork F11).
-- src:1045 | (b) Notwithstanding the other provisions of this section, no reduction of capital shall be made or effected unless the assets of the corporation remaining after such reduction shall be sufficient to pay any debts of the corporation for which payment has not been otherwise provided. No reduction of capital shall release any liability of any stockholder whose shares have not been fully paid.
@ref 8 Del. C. § 244(b) (src:1045)
GIVEN `the assets of the corporation remaining after the reduction` IS A NUMBER
      `the debts of the corporation for which payment has not been otherwise provided` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 244(b) the assets remaining after the reduction are sufficient to pay the debts` `the assets of the corporation remaining after the reduction` `the debts of the corporation for which payment has not been otherwise provided` MEANS
    `the assets of the corporation remaining after the reduction` AT LEAST `the debts of the corporation for which payment has not been otherwise provided`

@ref 8 Del. C. § 244(a) (src:1040-1044); § 244(b) (src:1045)
GIVEN r IS A `dg5 s 244(a) Proposed reduction of capital`
      `the assets of the corporation remaining after the reduction` IS A NUMBER
      `the debts of the corporation for which payment has not been otherwise provided` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 244 the corporation may reduce its capital` r `the assets of the corporation remaining after the reduction` `the debts of the corporation for which payment has not been otherwise provided` MEANS
        `s 244(a) the reduction of capital is of a kind and an amount the subsection permits` r
    AND `s 244(b) the assets remaining after the reduction are sufficient to pay the debts` `the assets of the corporation remaining after the reduction` `the debts of the corporation for which payment has not been otherwise provided`

-- src:1045 | No reduction of capital shall release any liability of any stockholder whose shares have not been fully paid.
@ref 8 Del. C. § 244(b) (src:1045)
-- NOTHING: the stockholder's shares are fully paid, so there is no liability for the sentence to speak of.
GIVEN `the stockholder's shares have been fully paid` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 244(b) the stockholder's liability on the shares not fully paid survives the reduction of capital` `the stockholder's shares have been fully paid` MEANS
    IF `the stockholder's shares have been fully paid` THEN NOTHING ELSE JUST TRUE

§ `Section 245 -- restated certificate of incorporation`

-- out of range: section 104 (piece dg1)
-- src:1050 | (a) A corporation may, whenever desired, integrate into a single instrument all of the provisions of its certificate of incorporation which are then in effect and operative as a result of there having theretofore been filed with the Secretary of State 1 or more certificates or other instruments pursuant to any of the sections referred to in § 104 of this title, and it may at the same time also further amend its certificate of incorporation by adopting a restated certificate of incorporation.
@ref 8 Del. C. § 245(a) (src:1050)
GIVEN `the restated certificate integrates into a single instrument all the provisions of the certificate of incorporation that are then in effect and operative` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 245(a) the corporation may adopt the restated certificate of incorporation` `the restated certificate integrates into a single instrument all the provisions of the certificate of incorporation that are then in effect and operative` MEANS
    `the restated certificate integrates into a single instrument all the provisions of the certificate of incorporation that are then in effect and operative`

-- src:1051 | (b) If the restated certificate of incorporation merely restates and integrates but does not further amend the certificate of incorporation, as theretofore amended or supplemented by any instrument that was filed pursuant to any of the sections mentioned in § 104 of this title, it may be adopted by the board of directors without a vote of the stockholders, or it may be proposed by the directors and submitted by them to the stockholders for adoption, in which case the procedure and vote required, if any, by § 242 of this title for amendment of the certificate of incorporation shall be applicable. If the restated certificate of incorporation restates and integrates and also further amends in any respect the certificate of incorporation, as theretofore amended or supplemented, it shall be proposed by the directors and adopted by the stockholders in the manner and by the vote prescribed by § 242 of this title or, if the corporation has not received any payment for any of its stock, in the manner and by the vote prescribed by § 241 of this title.
@ref 8 Del. C. § 245(b) (src:1051)
DECLARE `dg5 s 245(b) How the restated certificate is adopted` IS ONE OF
    `by the board of directors without a vote of the stockholders`
    `proposed by the directors and submitted to the stockholders, with the procedure and vote required, if any, by section 242`
    `proposed by the directors and adopted by the stockholders in the manner and by the vote prescribed by section 242`
    `adopted in the manner and by the vote prescribed by section 241`

-- A restated certificate that merely restates and integrates: the board without a vote, or (at the directors' choice) submitted to the stockholders under section 242.
-- One that also further amends: proposed by the directors and adopted by the stockholders under section 242 or, if no payment has been received for any stock, under section 241.
@ref 8 Del. C. § 245(b) (src:1051)
GIVEN `the restated certificate merely restates and integrates but does not further amend the certificate` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the corporation has not received any payment for any of its stock` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the directors submit the restated certificate to the stockholders for adoption` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `dg5 s 245(b) How the restated certificate is adopted`
`s 245(b) how the restated certificate must be adopted` `the restated certificate merely restates and integrates but does not further amend the certificate` `the corporation has not received any payment for any of its stock` `the directors submit the restated certificate to the stockholders for adoption` MEANS
    IF `the restated certificate merely restates and integrates but does not further amend the certificate`
    THEN IF `the directors submit the restated certificate to the stockholders for adoption`
         THEN `proposed by the directors and submitted to the stockholders, with the procedure and vote required, if any, by section 242`
         ELSE `by the board of directors without a vote of the stockholders`
    ELSE IF `the corporation has not received any payment for any of its stock`
         THEN `adopted in the manner and by the vote prescribed by section 241`
         ELSE `proposed by the directors and adopted by the stockholders in the manner and by the vote prescribed by section 242`

-- src:1052 | (c) A restated certificate of incorporation shall be specifically designated as such in its heading. It shall state, either in its heading or in an introductory paragraph, the corporation’s present name, and, if it has been changed, the name under which it was originally incorporated, and the date of filing of its original certificate of incorporation with the Secretary of State. A restated certificate shall also state that it was duly adopted in accordance with this section. If it was adopted by the board of directors without a vote of the stockholders (unless it was adopted pursuant to § 241 of this title or without a vote of members pursuant to 242(b)(3) of this title), it shall state that it only restates and integrates and does not further amend (except, if applicable, as permitted under § 242(a)(1) and § 242(d)(1)(A) of this title) the provisions of the corporation’s certificate of incorporation as theretofore amended or supplemented, and that there is no discrepancy between those provisions and the provisions of the restated certificate. A restated certificate of incorporation may omit (a) such provisions of the original certificate of incorporation which named the incorporator or incorporators, the initial board of directors and the original subscribers for shares, and (b) such provisions contained in any amendment to the certificate of incorporation as were necessary to effect a change, exchange, reclassification, subdivision, combination or cancellation of stock, if such change, exchange, reclassification, subdivision, combination or cancellation has become effective. Any such omissions shall not be deemed a further amendment.
@ref 8 Del. C. § 245(c) (src:1052)
DECLARE `dg5 s 245(c) Restated certificate of incorporation` HAS
    `it is specifically designated as a restated certificate in its heading` IS A BOOLEAN
    `it states the corporation's present name in its heading or in an introductory paragraph` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the corporation's name has been changed since it was originally incorporated` IS A BOOLEAN
    `it states the name under which the corporation was originally incorporated` IS A BOOLEAN
    `it states the date of filing of the original certificate of incorporation with the Secretary of State` IS A BOOLEAN
    `it states that it was duly adopted in accordance with section 245` IS A BOOLEAN
    `it was adopted by the board of directors without a vote of the stockholders, other than under section 241 or without a vote of members under section 242(b)(3)` IS A BOOLEAN
    `it states that it only restates and integrates and does not further amend the provisions as theretofore amended or supplemented, and that there is no discrepancy between those provisions and the provisions of the restated certificate` IS A BOOLEAN

@ref 8 Del. C. § 245(c) (src:1052)
GIVEN c IS A `dg5 s 245(c) Restated certificate of incorporation`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 245(c) the restated certificate states what it must` c MEANS
        c's `it is specifically designated as a restated certificate in its heading`
    AND c's `it states the corporation's present name in its heading or in an introductory paragraph`
    AND ((NOT c's `the corporation's name has been changed since it was originally incorporated`) OR c's `it states the name under which the corporation was originally incorporated`)
    AND c's `it states the date of filing of the original certificate of incorporation with the Secretary of State`
    AND c's `it states that it was duly adopted in accordance with section 245`
    AND ((NOT c's `it was adopted by the board of directors without a vote of the stockholders, other than under section 241 or without a vote of members under section 242(b)(3)`)
         OR c's `it states that it only restates and integrates and does not further amend the provisions as theretofore amended or supplemented, and that there is no discrepancy between those provisions and the provisions of the restated certificate`)

-- src:1052 | A restated certificate of incorporation may omit (a) such provisions of the original certificate of incorporation which named the incorporator or incorporators, the initial board of directors and the original subscribers for shares, and (b) such provisions contained in any amendment to the certificate of incorporation as were necessary to effect a change, exchange, reclassification, subdivision, combination or cancellation of stock, if such change, exchange, reclassification, subdivision, combination or cancellation has become effective. Any such omissions shall not be deemed a further amendment.
@ref 8 Del. C. § 245(c) (src:1052)
DECLARE `dg5 s 245(c) Provision omitted from the restated certificate` IS ONE OF
    `provisions of the original certificate of incorporation which named the incorporator or incorporators, the initial board of directors and the original subscribers for shares`
    `provisions contained in an amendment as were necessary to effect a change, exchange, reclassification, subdivision, combination or cancellation of stock that has become effective`
    `any other provision than the two that section 245(c) lets a restated certificate omit`

-- "Any such omissions shall not be deemed a further amendment." NOTHING: for any other provision the subsection says nothing.
@ref 8 Del. C. § 245(c) (src:1052)
GIVEN o IS A `dg5 s 245(c) Provision omitted from the restated certificate`
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 245(c) the omission is deemed not to be a further amendment` o MEANS
    CONSIDER o
    WHEN `provisions of the original certificate of incorporation which named the incorporator or incorporators, the initial board of directors and the original subscribers for shares` THEN JUST TRUE
    WHEN `provisions contained in an amendment as were necessary to effect a change, exchange, reclassification, subdivision, combination or cancellation of stock that has become effective` THEN JUST TRUE
    WHEN `any other provision than the two that section 245(c) lets a restated certificate omit` THEN NOTHING

-- out of range: section 103 (piece dg1)
-- src:1053 | (d) A restated certificate of incorporation shall be executed, acknowledged and filed in accordance with § 103 of this title. Upon its filing with the Secretary of State, the original certificate of incorporation, as theretofore amended or supplemented, shall be superseded; thenceforth, the restated certificate of incorporation, including any further amendments or changes made thereby, shall be the certificate of incorporation of the corporation, but the original date of incorporation shall remain unchanged.
@ref 8 Del. C. § 245(d) (src:1053)
GIVEN `the restated certificate was executed, acknowledged and filed in accordance with s 103` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 245(d) the restated certificate supersedes the original certificate of incorporation as theretofore amended or supplemented` `the restated certificate was executed, acknowledged and filed in accordance with s 103` MEANS
    `the restated certificate was executed, acknowledged and filed in accordance with s 103`

-- src:1053 | but the original date of incorporation shall remain unchanged.
@ref 8 Del. C. § 245(d) (src:1053)
GIVEN `the original date of incorporation` IS A DATE
GIVETH A DATE
`s 245(d) the date of incorporation after the restated certificate is filed` `the original date of incorporation` MEANS
    `the original date of incorporation`

-- src:1054 | (e) Any amendment or change effected in connection with the restatement and integration of the certificate of incorporation shall be subject to any other provision of this chapter, not inconsistent with this section, which would apply if a separate certificate of amendment were filed to effect such amendment or change.
@ref 8 Del. C. § 245(e) (src:1054)
GIVEN `the provision would apply if a separate certificate of amendment were filed to effect the amendment or change` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the provision is inconsistent with section 245` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 245(e) the amendment or change in the restatement is subject to the provision` `the provision would apply if a separate certificate of amendment were filed to effect the amendment or change` `the provision is inconsistent with section 245` MEANS
        `the provision would apply if a separate certificate of amendment were filed to effect the amendment or change`
    AND (NOT `the provision is inconsistent with section 245`)
